cyclic tag steps that emulate steps steps of a 2-color, range-1 cellular \
automaton on a tape of length tapeLength. \
CellularAutomatonToCyclicTagSteps[steps, tapeLength, k] gives the number of \
steps for a cellular automaton with k colors. \
CellularAutomatonToCyclicTagSteps[steps, tapeLength, k, r] gives the number \
of steps for a cellular automaton with k colors and range r.", 
